cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use gammaloop, cite the version-specific Zenodo DOI for the version
  you used.
title: gammaloop
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fraaije
    given-names: Mathijs
    affiliation: University of Bern
