abstract: >-
  GammaLoop computes differential collider cross-sections using Local
  Unitarity. Each versioned record preserves the source artifacts available for
  that release. Modern releases comprise gammalooprs, gammaloop-api, and the
  GammaLoop Python source distribution; historical layouts and artifact sets
  may differ.
keywords:
  - collider physics
  - differential cross-sections
  - Local Unitarity
  - perturbative quantum field theory
  - Rust
  - Python
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/alphal00p/gammaloop"
